{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "module": "ESNext",

    /* Was `"moduleResolution": "node"` (node10). TypeScript 6 deprecates that
       with an error and 7 removes it, so this is the migration rather than an
       `ignoreDeprecations` line that only buys the 6.x window. `bundler` is
       the honest description of how this workspace actually resolves: nothing
       here is emitted by tsc — the apps run under tsx, the web app is built by
       Vite — so module specifiers are resolved by a bundler or a loader, never
       by node's own algorithm against tsc output.

       `allowImportingTsExtensions` follows from that. Under `bundler`, a
       dependency that ships raw TypeScript (`jmap-rfc-types`) resolves to its
       `.ts` sources, whose own imports carry the extension; node10 resolution
       never reached them. It is safe only because every config here sets
       `noEmit` — tsc refuses the option otherwise — and it permits nothing at
       runtime that tsx and Vite did not already accept. */
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "lib": ["ES2022"],
    "strict": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "types": ["node"],
    "noEmit": true,
    "paths": {
      "@openmig/shared": ["./packages/shared/src/index.ts"],
      "@openmig/shared/*": ["./packages/shared/src/*"],
      "@openmig/ledger": ["./packages/ledger/src/index.ts"],
      "@openmig/ledger/*": ["./packages/ledger/src/*"],
      "@openmig/core": ["./packages/core/src/index.ts"],
      "@openmig/core/*": ["./packages/core/src/*"],
      "@openmig/worker/orchestration": ["./apps/worker/src/orchestration.ts"],
      "@openmig/scheduler/in-process": ["./packages/scheduler/src/scheduler.ts"],
      "@openmig/connectors": ["./packages/connectors/src/index.ts"],
      "@openmig/connectors/*": ["./packages/connectors/src/*"],
      "@openmig/engines": ["./packages/engines/src/index.ts"],
      "@openmig/engines/*": ["./packages/engines/src/*"],
      "@openmig/scheduler": ["./packages/scheduler/src/index.ts"],
      "@openmig/scheduler/*": ["./packages/scheduler/src/*"]
    }
  }
}
